	Oh to have everything! Oh to be completely self-sufficient and isolated, no need for Transfers with other people... Oh!

	Until interactions with other Actors are not longer Needed for the fullfilment from our most basic to our most enlightened Needs, Lince will Need the Transfer feature. Almost a position taken from axioms. Interactions, trades, agreements, proposals, contracts, donations, leases, borrowing, all can be taken care of by the Transfer feature, it is the ultimate collaboration details and agreements.

	- [ ] Resources
